{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5d3de15f2e9db5c98c18e7dd06f86b0906410862984aecdf38e8323232f1abee","ja":"さっきすれ違ったの、テレビでよく見るアイドルの人\nだったよね！　いろんな人がいるんだな～。","zh":"刚才擦肩而过的，是在电视上经常见到的偶像\n吧！真是什么样的人都有呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8e6445e37d267b3272d7c0dfdabde886fd8674784b4fd2f8e9beff4d7ded3719","ja":"はい、それに見たことない物がたくさんあって、\nすごいです！","zh":"好的，而且还有好多没见过的东西，\n太厉害了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7c4065786797e7c25c1dde67df4df1e583e78f5097f983b727c1b3085f471b54","ja":"ほら、ふたりとも。あんまりキョロキョロしてると、\nはぐれちゃうわよ……あら？　亜美と響は……？","zh":"好啦，你们两个。东张西望的话\n可是会走散的哦……哎呀？亚美和响呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4ea189d38e101540ae6366fbb766357e962aa01b576e3c8b67ec664f80661e3d","ja":"見て見て！\nこっちにケータリングがあるよ！","zh":"快看快看！\n这里有餐饮供应哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"249f8b609cf2da60e2cb7af71e01e15804a0807e5d6819f8bbd9e9e6150c6e1c","ja":"そういえば自分、お腹ペコペコだぞ！\nみんなでご飯にしない？","zh":"说起来我肚子都饿扁了！\n大家要不要一起去吃饭？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c0806818ac091233b2e5a8e6098935cdf3a1d7b3cea2c6e5ccf5d8428a162f27","ja":"お料理がいっぱい並んでますね！\n食べていいんでしょうか……？","zh":"摆了好多料理呢！\n可以吃吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b08d805ce98e8e3696b6bd5e2830aba86fcbf437da4bfca70197c772f2fc8723","ja":"いいんじゃないかな？\nカロリーを摂るのは、すっごく大切だからね♪","zh":"挺好的不是吗？\n摄取热量可是非常重要的呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c993b17e5a4eeb1d49caa56fc2f1eccc21a7fc0abb19f08729570257c5abdf44","ja":"それにこういう所に出してるお料理の味、\nすっごく気になるな～。","zh":"而且这种地方供应的菜肴味道如何，\n真的超让人好奇的呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d035b4a00fd2864720f90de7d598a71c2b9ea2006a19f8573d2dcf653999fa5f","ja":"ちょっと、あんたたち！\n何しに来たのか忘れてるんじゃないの？","zh":"喂，你们几个！\n是不是忘了自己是来干什么的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"4fcbf6e8d4fe36cc8962cc03b4a6b7ecb39d90a65beded34c9cfe3818d594b6c","ja":"あ、そうだった！　でも楽屋、全然見当たらないね。\n有名な人のなら、すぐわかりそうなんだけどな……。","zh":"啊，对哦！不过完全找不到休息室呢。\n要是名人的话，感觉应该马上就能看出来才对……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1282.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"8b5a25f1679673137a5b31ba102e0a28f175aee85bcdcee0d80389a1aab3655d","ja":"あっ、見てください、あそこ！\n人がたくさん集まってますよ！","zh":"啊，您看那边！\n聚集了好多人呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
